# Meridian ui-next — environment
#
# Base URL of the Java API service (services/src/ca/meridian/api/ApiServer.java).
# In dev this is proxied through Vite (see vite.config.ts). In production the
# release pipeline was *supposed* to template this the way the legacy console's
# sed hack does; that pipeline stage was never written. Set it by hand for now.
VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8081
